WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.260
If your hair is still falling out after everything you have tried, Hammy, I know exactly what you have been missing.

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:20.100
This was my client's hair before, and this is her hair after just three months of me treating her right here in my salon chair.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:27.420
I have been behind this chair long enough to know that the women who get their hair back are never the ones who tried the most things.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.800
They are the ones who finally started doing the right things correctly.

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:35.120
The first thing I correct with every thinning client is their relationship with their scalp.

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:41.440
Most women are out here treating their ends while their scalp, they're suffocating.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:48.060
I'm focused on daily stimulation of those dormant areas first because that is where every conversation about regrowth has to begin.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.420
No exceptions in my salon.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:56.860
The second thing I look at is what they are putting on their scalp and whether it is actually doing anything.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:02.500
Nourishing the root level with the right warming and penetrating ingredients is what rebuilds

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.540
damage strands from the inside.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:10.340
I have seen this work on clients who have already given up hope, sitting right in my

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:11.340
chair.

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:13.260
Eard, I deal with the buildup.

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:17.800
Years of product and neglect layer on top of the scalp and physically block new growth

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:18.860
from coming through.

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:24.620
I make removing that barrier a non-negotiable first step because until it is gone, everything

00:01:24.620 --> 00:01:26.800
else is just sitting on top of the problem.

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:33.720
I send every client home with a three month plan, no suggestions, a real plan with a real schedule.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:41.240
The clients who follow it are the ones who come back and show me exactly what is possible. And

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:47.440
when my clients are ready to take everything we just built in this chair and protect it at home,

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:52.080
the one thing I put in their hands before they walk out is La Bonta Batana oil paste. It melts

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:58.160
right into the strands, brings back what dryness and damage have quietly taken away and leaves

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:04.440
behind a softness and glow that does not need any explanation. You can find it on Amazon by

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:09.920
searching La Bonta and just make sure you are picking up the exact right one.
